  "name": "SW: Score and Route Lead",
  "description": null,
  "active": true,
  "isArchived": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SW: Score and Route Lead\n\n**Subworkflow.** Scores a lead from 0–10 using configurable thresholds and returns a tier: **hot**, **warm**, or **cold**. Used after voice qualification and lead sourcing.\n\n**Scoring factors:** decision maker, budget mentioned, employee count, pain point, reviews, website, rating, phone.\n\n**Input:** Fields such as `decisionMaker`, `budgetMentioned`, `employeeCount`, `painPoint`, `reviewCount`, `hasWebsite`, `rating`, `hasPhone`.\n\n**Output:** `{ success, data: { score, tier }, error }`. Thresholds come from CONFIG.",
        "height": 352,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "04c9b6db-71c5-47df-994f-78550bf4a5d3",
      "name": "Note — About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        864,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "f4b5291f-e7b2-4f55-a25b-623ad1eed54c",
      "name": "Execute Workflow Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        816,
        592
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const input = $('Execute Workflow Trigger').first().json;\nconst config = $(\"Call 'CONFIG — Global Settings'\").first().json;\n\nlet score = 0;\n\nif (input.decisionMaker) score += 2;\nif (input.budgetMentioned) score += 2;\n\nconst empCount = parseInt(input.employeeCount) || 0;\nif (empCount >= 50) score += 2;\nelse if (empCount >= 10) score += 1;\n\nif (input.painPoint && input.painPoint.trim().length > 0) score += 1;\n\nconst reviewCount = parseInt(input.reviewCount) || 0;\nif (reviewCount >= 50) score += 1;\nelse if (reviewCount >= 10) score += 0.5;\n\nif (input.hasWebsite) score += 0.5;\n\nconst rating = parseFloat(input.rating) || 0;\nif (rating >= 4.0) score += 1;\nelse if (rating < 3.0 && rating > 0) score -= 1;\n\nif (input.hasPhone) score += 0.5;\n\nscore = Math.round(score * 10) / 10;\n\nlet tier;\nif (score >= config.scoring.hotLeadThreshold) {\n  tier = 'hot';\n} else if (score >= config.scoring.warmLeadThreshold) {\n  tier = 'warm';\n} else {\n  tier = 'cold';\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    success: true,\n    data: { score: score, tier: tier },\n    error: null\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "b86597ea-1a48-4f4c-a032-001dffeba189",
      "name": "Calculate Score",
